1.4.m:
'Homage to the lord of the earth! Homage to the lord of the world! Homage to the lord of beings! Homage to prosperity! I take refuge in the in-breath; I take refuge in the out-breath; I take refuge in the diffused breath; I take refuge in speech; I take refuge in the eye; I take refuge in the ear; I take refuge in the mind; I take refuge in the self;
I take refuge in the gāyatrī; I take refuge in the triṣṭubh; I take refuge in the jagatī; I take refuge in the anuṣṭubh; I take refuge in the metres! May the Sun protect us from the sky! Homage to the great ones! Homage to the small ones!'
